WEBVTT

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.630
You don't even have to be a sports fan.

00:09:00.663 --> 00:09:04.297
You just have to believe
in basic ideas of fairness

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.530
and the values of higher education.

00:09:08.463 --> 00:09:10.730
So let's require that all college athletes

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:13.263
are given a chance
at a meaningful education.

00:09:14.663 --> 00:09:18.197
Let's demand responsible spending
by our universities

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:21.463
and fairly allocate the billions
of dollars being generated.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:24.563
Let's create robust
health and safety standards

00:09:24.563 --> 00:09:27.863
to protect those
who entertain us with their bodies

00:09:27.897 --> 00:09:29.597
and enforce those standards.